237 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Large Language Models have improved Text-to-SQL tasks, but they still struggle with complex, multi-step reasoning. To address this, we propose Structured Chain-of-Thought \(SCoT\), which guides the model through a clear, structured process. We compare SCoT with several prompting methods and find that it performs the best across all settings. On Gemini 2.5 Pro and GPT-4o-mini, SCoT reaches 84.33% and 70.20% execution accuracy, clearly outperforming baselines. Our seven-stage pipeline produces no execution errors, showing that light structure and multiple candidate solutions can make Text-to-SQL far more reliable without extra training or annotation.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
